<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>NEC Nijmegen 1 (Graef 72) Feyenoord 2 (Taument 39, 89).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-1. Attendance 7,401.</p>
<p>Twente Endchede 1 (Bruggink 73) AZ Alkmaar 0. 0-0. Attendance</p>
<p>7,500.</p>
<p>Volendam 1 (Aandewiel 8) Vitesse Arnhem 1 (Del Olmo 79). 1-0.</p>
<p>3,354.</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam 0 PSV Eindhoven 2 (Jonk 43, Nilis 90). 0-1.</p>
<p>50,000.</p>
<p>Groningen v Graafschap Doetindchem postponed.</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade 6 (Van Hoogdalem 7, Doomernik 19, 78, Van</p>
<p>Houdt 68, Sibon 72, Martens 77) Heerenveen 1 (Tomasson 45).</p>
<p>2-1. 6,000.</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 0 RKC Waalwijk 0. 4,500.</p>
<p>Played Friday:</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 3 (Konterman 27, 31, Heering 54) Utrecht 0.</p>
<p>2-0. 9,950.</p>
